# Build-context filter for src/FlightRadar.Api/Dockerfile only. BuildKit uses "<Dockerfile name>.dockerignore"
# next to the Dockerfile instead of the root .dockerignore, so each image can send a different context.
#
# Allow-list style: ignore everything, then re-include only what the API build needs. New folders (web/, docs,
# test data) stay out of the context automatically instead of needing to be remembered here.
*
!Directory.Build.props
!dotnet-tools.json
!src/

# ...but never build output from your machine: the image compiles its own.
**/bin/
**/obj/
